Hello everyone! :)
I've finally fallen completely under Chiikawa's spell,,
Yes, I'm a little late to the party??
As I briefly mentioned in the pinned comment on yesterday's Shorts,
I'm feeling much better now!
Luckily(?), I had already filmed quite a few daily vlogs and Chiikawa adventures before my surgery,
so here I am with a solo Chiikawa hunting vlog!
I've always had a bit of a fangirl side,
but it's been a while since I've been this obsessed with something,,?
Chiikawa isn't just adorable,
it's also a story that reflects so much of our everyday lives!
Honestly, you could even say it's more for adults than kids,,
It's seriously such a brilliant anime??
Anyway, I successfully completed my Chiikawa hunting mission in Yongsan,
and I've got some delicious food spots to share with you too!
I hope you enjoy today's video,
and I'll see you in the next one!
Una!??

